---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Vendor pricing — free listings, $40/mo featured | Colorado Elopement Guide"
  description="Every listing is free. Featured placement is $40/month — first month $1 — with click and inquiry reporting and no contract.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="display text-3xl text-pine-900">Simple, honest vendor pricing</h1>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-8">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6">
        <h2 class="display text-xl text-pine-900">Listed</h2>
        <p class="display text-3xl mt-2">$0<span class="text-base text-stone-400">/forever</span></p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-600">
          <li>✓ Full listing with your details, ratings and links</li>
          <li>✓ Claim it to edit anytime</li>
          <li>✓ Monthly click &amp; inquiry counts</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/claim" class="inline-block mt-6 rounded-lg border border-pine-800 text-pine-800 hover:bg-pine-50 px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-sm">Claim your listing</a>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-clay-500 bg-white p-6 relative">
        <span class="absolute -top-3 left-6 bg-clay-500 text-white text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded">First month $1</span>
        <h2 class="display text-xl text-pine-900">Featured</h2>
        <p class="display text-3xl mt-2">$40<span class="text-base text-stone-400">/month</span></p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-600">
          <li>✓ Top of your category and region pages, labeled "Featured"</li>
          <li>✓ Homepage rotation</li>
          <li>✓ Photo gallery + packages on your listing</li>
          <li>✓ Annual option: 12 months for the price of 10</li>
          <li>✓ Cancel anytime — no contract</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-stone-500">For comparison: premium placement on the big national wedding platforms reportedly runs $200–1,200 per month.</p>
        <a href="/claim" class="inline-block mt-4 rounded-lg bg-clay-500 hover:bg-clay-600 text-white px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-sm">Start with your free listing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 mt-6">Featured placement is always labeled. Placement never changes the Google ratings shown, and we never write or alter reviews.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
